        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quase Rosa features basic mechanics: <strong>double jump</strong>, <strong>dash</strong> and <strong>ston</strong>e. However, each time you try to pass a level, only one different skill is possible. In other words, if you die or restart the level, you'll have a 33% chance of picking up any of the three skills at random, which may or may not make it easier to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a system of <strong>Percentage Cards</strong>, where you can increase the probability of playing with a desired skill. The player can choose between 50%, 75% and 100% cards and then select which skill they want to use the card for.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quase Rosa features basic mechanics: <strong>double jump</strong>, <strong>dash</strong> and <strong>ston</strong>e. However, each time you try to pass a level, only one different skill is possible. In other words, if you die or restart the level, you'll have a 33% chance of picking up any of the three skills at random, which may or may not make it easier to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a system of <strong>Percentage Cards</strong>, where you can increase the probability of playing with a desired skill. The player can choose between 50%, 75% and 100% cards and then select which skill they want to use the card for.</p>",
